data: {"id": "d4b8157a479a44a4-thinking-parallel_evidence-1433", "run_id": "d4b8157a479a44a4", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "Now I have clear evidence. Let me summarize the key findings:\n\n## 证据结论\n\n### 已确认事实（支持 NotReady 根因）\n\n1. **Pod 状态**: `Running` 但 `READY=0/1`，`ContainersNotReady`，由 kubelet 持续标记 NotReady。\n\n2. **Readiness Probe 配置**: `http-get http://:18081/ready`，delay=5s, timeout=1s, period=5s。探针指向 **端口 18081** 的 `/ready` 路径。\n\n3. **容器实际监听**: 日志显示 `listening on 18080`，YAML 中 command 显示容器启动了一个 `ThreadingHTTPServer` 监听在 **端口 18080** 的 `/health` 路径。\n\n4. **探针失败原文**: `Readiness probe failed: Get \"http://172.16.104.33:180", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789387398126, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

